## Ported from stb_perlin, and altered

`src/net/b12n/raylib_ios/perlin.cljc` ports Sean Barrett's stb_perlin.h v0.5 as shipped in
raylib 6.0's `src/external`, with its permutation and gradient tables copied. It
is an altered version: it is written in Clojure, not C, and rounds every
intermediate to a 32-bit float where the C does. stb_perlin.h offers MIT or
public domain at the user's choice. This project takes it under the MIT
alternative, as it does every other MIT source here, and reproduces the notice.
The compiled stb_perlin inside libraylib.a is covered by raylib's notice under
"Linked".

